    <string name="about_copyright">© %1$d</string>
    <string name="about_credits">Open source under MIT. Built on top of the reverse-engineered Ninebot 2nd-gen NinebotCrypto protocol. Crypto primitives derived from the ScooterHacking Utility (SHU) decompile; settings register map extracted from SHU\'s runtime bootstrap.</string>

